   .... Check that `+typedExpressionIR'?+` matches pattern `+(_)+`
   .... Let `+?(typedExpressionIR_reduced)+` be `+typedExpressionIR'+`?
   .... Let `+typeIR_reduced+` be <<typeof_expression, the type of  `+typedExpressionIR_reduced+`>>
   .... Let `+ctk_reduced+` be <<ctkof_expression, the compile-time known-ness of  `+typedExpressionIR_reduced+`>>
