   .... Let `+typeIR_init+` be <<typeof_expression, the type of  `+typedExpressionIR_init+`>>
   .... Check that `+<<ctkof_expression, the compile-time known-ness of  typedExpressionIR_init>>+` matches pattern `+LCTK+`
   .... Let `+typedExpressionIR?+` be `+$coerce_unary(typedExpressionIR_init, typeIR)+`
   .... Check that `+typedExpressionIR?+` matches pattern `+(_)+`
   .... Let `+?(typedExpressionIR_init_cast)+` be `+typedExpressionIR+`?
   .... Let `+nameIR+` be `+$name(name)+`
   .... Let `+value_init+` be <<Eval_static, the static evaluation of `+typedExpressionIR_init_cast+`, under cursor `+p+` and typing context `+TC+`>>
   .... Result in `+annotationList direction typeIR nameIR ?(= value_init)+` and `+tid_fresh*+`

