. If `+methodPrototype+` matches pattern `+%  % ;+`
 .. Let `+annotationList typeOrVoid name typeParameterListOpt ( parameterList ) ;+` be `+methodPrototype+`
 .. Group non-abstract: `+TC_0+`, `+tid_extern+`, and `+annotationList typeOrVoid name typeParameterListOpt ( parameterList ) ;+`

  ... Let `+nameIR+` be `+$name(name)+`
  ... Check that `+nameIR+` is not equal to `+tid_extern+`
