  ... Let `+tid_expl*+` be the list of `+tid_expl+`, obtained by repeating:
   .... Let `+tid_expl+` be `+$name(typeParameter)+`
  ... for each `+typeParameter+` in `+typeParameter*+`
  ... Let `+TC_1+` be `+$add_types(LOCAL, TC_0, tid_expl*, TID tid_expl*)+`
  ... Let `+typeIR_ret+` and `+tid*+` be <<Type_ok, the result of typing `+typeOrVoid+`, under cursor `+LOCAL+` and typing context `+TC_1+`,
and the set of inserted type variables>>
