  ... Let `+parameterIR*+` and `+tid_impl*+` be <<Parameters_ok, the result of typing `+parameter*+`, under cursor `+LOCAL+` and typing context `+TC_2+`>>
  ... Let `+parameterTypeIR*+` be the list of `+parameterTypeIR+`, obtained by repeating:
