  ... Let `+TC_1+`, `+flow+`, and `+statementIR+` be <<Stmt_ok, the result of typing `+directApplicationStatement+`, under cursor `+LOCAL+`, typing context `+TC_0'+`, and flow `+CONT+`, with the modified typing context and flow>>
  ... Check that `+flow+` matches pattern `+CONT+`
