relation TableKey_ok: `+TC+`, `+TBLC_0+`, and `+expression : name_matchkind annotationList ;+`

. Group : `+TC+`, `+TBLC_0+`, and `+expression : name_matchkind annotationList ;+`

 .. Let `+typedExpressionIR+` be <<Expr_ok, the result of typing `+expression+`, under cursor `+LOCAL+` and typing context `+TC+`>>
 .. Let `+typeIR+` be <<typeof_expression, the type of  `+typedExpressionIR+`>>
 .. If [`+SET < [typeIR] >+` is a well-formed type, assuming bound type ids `+$bound(LOCAL, TC)+`](Type_wf), then
  ... Let `+nameIR_matchkind+` be `+$name(name_matchkind)+`
  ... Check that `+MATCH_KIND . nameIR_matchkind+` is equal to `+$find_value(LOCAL, TC, ` nameIR_matchkind)+`
  ... Check that `+$compat_table_key(nameIR_matchkind, typeIR)+`
  ... Let `+TBLC_1+` be `+$update_mode(TBLC_0, nameIR_matchkind, typeIR)+`
  ... Let `+TBLC_2+` be `+$add_key(TBLC_1, nameIR_matchkind, typeIR)+`
  ... Let `+tableKeyIR+` be `+typedExpressionIR : nameIR_matchkind annotationList ;+`
  ... Result in `+TBLC_2+` and `+tableKeyIR+`

