. Group : `+TC+`, `+parameterTypeIR+`*, and `+argumentIR+`*

 .. Let `+(parameterTypeIR_data* and parameterTypeIR_control*)+` be `+$split_dataplane_parameters(parameterTypeIR*)+`
 .. Check that the length of `+parameterTypeIR_data+`* is equal to the length of `+argumentIR+`*
 .. (Call_convention_ok: `+LOCAL TC ACTION |- parameterTypeIR_data* @ argumentIR* : argumentIR_cast*+`)
 .. Result in `+parameterTypeIR_data*+`, `+parameterTypeIR_control*+`, and `+argumentIR_cast*+`

relation TableAction_ok: `+TC+`, `+TBLC_0+`, and `+annotationList tableActionReference ;+`

. If `+tableActionReference+` has type `+prefixedNonTypeName+`
 .. Let `+prefixedNonTypeName+` be `+tableActionReference+`
 .. Group prefixedNonTypeName: `+TC+`, `+TBLC_0+`, and `+annotationList prefixedNonTypeName ;+`

  ... Let `+prefixedNameIR+` be `+$prefixedNonTypeName(prefixedNonTypeName)+`
  ... Let `+routineTypeDefIR'?+` be `+$find_routine_non_overloaded(LOCAL, TC, prefixedNameIR)+`
  ... Check that `+routineTypeDefIR'?+` matches pattern `+(_)+`
  ... Let `+?(routineTypeDefIR)+` be `+routineTypeDefIR'+`?
  ... Check that `+routineTypeDefIR+` has type `+functionTypeIR+`
  ... Let `+functionTypeIR+` be `+routineTypeDefIR+`
  ... Check that `+functionTypeIR+` matches pattern `+ACTION ( % )+`
  ... Let `+ACTION ( parameterTypeIR* )+` be `+functionTypeIR+`
  ... (Call_action_partial_ok: `+TC |- parameterTypeIR* @ [] : parameterTypeIR_data* , parameterTypeIR_control* @ argumentIR*+`)
  ... Check that `+argumentIR*+` matches pattern `+[]+`
  ... Let `+TBLC_1+` be `+$add_action(TBLC_0, prefixedNameIR, parameterTypeIR*, [])+`
  ... Let `+tableActionIR+` be `+annotationList prefixedNameIR ( [] ) ;+`
  ... Result in `+TBLC_1+` and `+tableActionIR+`
. If `+tableActionReference+` matches pattern `+% ( % )+`
 .. Let `+prefixedNonTypeName ( argumentList )+` be `+tableActionReference+`
 .. Group prefixedNonTypeName-argumentList: `+TC+`, `+TBLC_0+`, and `+annotationList prefixedNonTypeName ( argumentList ) ;+`

  ... Let `+prefixedNameIR+` be `+$prefixedNonTypeName(prefixedNonTypeName)+`
  ... Let `+routineTypeDefIR'?+` be `+$find_routine_non_overloaded(LOCAL, TC, prefixedNameIR)+`
  ... Check that `+routineTypeDefIR'?+` matches pattern `+(_)+`
  ... Let `+?(routineTypeDefIR)+` be `+routineTypeDefIR'+`?
  ... Check that `+routineTypeDefIR+` has type `+functionTypeIR+`
  ... Let `+functionTypeIR+` be `+routineTypeDefIR+`
  ... Check that `+functionTypeIR+` matches pattern `+ACTION ( % )+`
  ... Let `+ACTION ( parameterTypeIR* )+` be `+functionTypeIR+`
  ... Let `+argument*+` be `+$flatten_argumentList(argumentList)+`
  ... Let `+argumentIR*+` be the list of `+argumentIR+`, obtained by repeating:
   .... Let `+argumentIR+` be <<Argument_ok, the result of typing `+argument+`, under cursor `+LOCAL+` and typing context `+TC+`>>
  ... for each `+argument+` in `+argument*+`
  ... (Call_action_partial_ok: `+TC |- parameterTypeIR* @ argumentIR* : parameterTypeIR_data* , parameterTypeIR_control* @ argumentIR_cast*+`)
  ... Let `+TBLC_1+` be `+$add_action(TBLC_0, prefixedNameIR, parameterTypeIR*, argumentIR_cast*)+`
  ... Let `+tableActionIR+` be `+annotationList prefixedNameIR ( argumentIR_cast* ) ;+`
  ... Result in `+TBLC_1+` and `+tableActionIR+`

