relation TableDefaultAction_ok: `+TC+`, `+TBLC+`, and `+= expression+`

. If `+expression+` has type `+prefixedNonTypeName+`
 .. Let `+prefixedNonTypeName+` be `+expression+`
 .. Group prefixedNonTypeName: `+TC+`, `+TBLC+`, and `+= prefixedNonTypeName+`

  ... Let `+prefixedNameIR+` be `+$prefixedNonTypeName(prefixedNonTypeName)+`
