     ...... Let `+id_field+` be `+nameIR ++ "." ++ nameIR_field+`
    ..... for each `+nameIR_field+` in `+nameIR_field*+`
    ..... Let `+value_field*+` be the list of `+value_field+`, obtained by repeating:
     ...... Let `+value_field+` be `+nameIR . nameIR_field+`
    ..... for each `+nameIR_field+` in `+nameIR_field*+`
    ..... Let `+TC_2+` be `+$add_vars(GLOBAL, TC_1, id_field*, typeIR_enum LCTK ?(value_field)*)+`
