    ..... Check that `+$callable_extern_method(p, TC)+`
    ..... (Call_convention_ok: `+p TC NOACTION |- parameterTypeIR_aligned_inferred* @ argumentIR* : argumentIR_cast*+`)
    ..... Result in `+typeIR_ret_inferred+`, `+typeArgumentIR_inferred*+`, and `+argumentIR_cast*+`

