. Check that `+cursor'+` matches pattern `+GLOBAL+`
. Group package: `+GLOBAL+`, `+TC+`, `+instctxt+`, `+constructorTypeIR+`, `+typeArgumentIR+`*, `+tid_infer+`*, `+argumentIR+`*, and `+id_default+`*

 .. Let `+CONSTRUCTOR ( parameterTypeIR* ) -> typeIR_object+` be `+constructorTypeIR+`
