relation ExternMethod_inst: `+IC_0+` and `+methodPrototypeIR+`

. If `+methodPrototypeIR+` matches pattern `+%  % ;+`
 .. Let `+annotationList typeIR nameIR < typeParameterListIR , typeParameterListIR_inferred > ( parameterListIR ) ;+` be `+methodPrototypeIR+`
 .. Group non-abstract: `+IC_0+` and `+annotationList typeIR nameIR < typeParameterListIR , typeParameterListIR_inferred > ( parameterListIR ) ;+`

  ... Let `+rid+` be `+$rid_IR(nameIR, parameterListIR)+`
  ... Let `+method+` be `+EXTERN_METHOD < typeParameterListIR ++ typeParameterListIR_inferred > ( parameterListIR ) ?({ [] })+`
  ... Let `+IC_1+` be `+$add_routine_overload_inst(BLOCK, IC_0, rid, method)+`
  ... Result in `+IC_1+`

. Else if `+methodPrototypeIR+` matches pattern `+% ABSTRACT % ;+`
 .. Let `+annotationList ABSTRACT typeIR nameIR < typeParameterListIR , typeParameterListIR_inferred > ( parameterListIR ) ;+` be `+methodPrototypeIR+`
 .. Group abstract: `+IC_0+` and `+annotationList ABSTRACT typeIR nameIR < typeParameterListIR , typeParameterListIR_inferred > ( parameterListIR ) ;+`

  ... Let `+rid+` be `+$rid_IR(nameIR, parameterListIR)+`
  ... Let `+method+` be `+EXTERN_METHOD ABSTRACT < typeParameterListIR ++ typeParameterListIR_inferred > ( parameterListIR )+`
  ... Let `+IC_1+` be `+$add_routine_overload_inst(BLOCK, IC_0, rid, method)+`
  ... Result in `+IC_1+`

relation ExternMethods_inst: `+IC'+` and `+methodPrototypeIR+`*

. If `+methodPrototypeIR*+` matches pattern `+[]+`
 .. Group nil: `+IC+` and `+[]+`

  ... Result in `+IC'+`

. Else if `+methodPrototypeIR*+` matches pattern `+_ :: _+`
 .. Let `+methodPrototypeIR_h :: methodPrototypeIR_t*+` be `+methodPrototypeIR+`*
 .. Group cons: `+IC_0+` and `+methodPrototypeIR_h :: methodPrototypeIR_t*+`

  ... (ExternMethod_inst: `+IC' |- methodPrototypeIR_h ==> IC_1+`)
