relation Decl_inst: `+cursor'+`, `+IC_0+`, `+STO'+`, and `+declarationIR+`

. If `+declarationIR+` has type `+constantDeclarationIR+`
 .. Let `+annotationList CONST typeIR nameIR = value ;+` be `+declarationIR+`
 .. Group constantDeclarationIR: `+cursor+`, `+IC_0+`, `+STO+`, and `+annotationList CONST typeIR nameIR = value ;+`

  ... If true
   .... Let `+IC_1+` be `+$add_value_inst(GLOBAL, IC_0, nameIR, value)+`
   .... Result in `+IC_1+`, `+STO'+`, and `+?()+`

  ... Else if false
   .... Let `+IC_1+` be `+$add_value_inst(cursor', IC_0, nameIR, value)+`
   .... Let `+constantDeclarationIR+` be `+annotationList CONST typeIR nameIR = value ;+`
   .... Result in `+IC_1+`, `+STO'+`, and `+?(constantDeclarationIR)+`

. Else if `+declarationIR+` has type `+instantiationIR+`
 .. Let `+annotationList typeIR prefixedNameIR < typeArgumentListIR > ( argumentListIR ) nameIR objectInitializerOptIR ;+` be `+declarationIR+`
 .. Group instantiationIR: `+cursor+`, `+IC_0+`, `+STO_0+`, and `+annotationList typeIR prefixedNameIR < typeArgumentListIR > ( argumentListIR ) nameIR objectInitializerOptIR ;+`

  ... If true
   .... Let `+(cid, constructor, id*)?+` be `+$find_constructor_inst(IC_0, prefixedNameIR, argumentListIR)+`
   .... Check that `+(cid, constructor, id*)?+` matches pattern `+(_)+`
   .... Let `+?((_, constructor, and id_default*))+` be `+(cid, constructor, id*)+`?
   .... Let `+IC_inner+` be `+$enter_path(IC_0, nameIR)+`
   .... (Constructor_inst: `+GLOBAL IC_inner STO' |- constructor < typeArgumentListIR > ( argumentListIR # id_default* ) ==> STO_1 object+`)
   .... If `+object+` has type `+externObject+`
    ..... Let `+EXTERN tid { tenv venv renv }+` be `+object+`
    ..... Let `+IC_decl+` be `+$empty_instantiationContext+`[PATH = `+IC_0.PATH+`][GLOBAL = `+IC_0.GLOBAL+`]
    ..... Let `+objectDeclarationListIR+` be `+$flatten_objectInitializerOptIR(objectInitializerOptIR)+`
    ..... (Decls_inst: `+BLOCK IC_decl STO_1 |- objectDeclarationListIR ==> IC_decl_post STO_2 _*+`)
    ..... Let `+venv_merged+` be `+$merge_venvs(venv, IC_decl_post.BLOCK.VENV)+`
    ..... Let `+renv_merged+` be `+$merge_renv_with_extern(renv, IC_decl_post.BLOCK.RENV)+`
    ..... Let `+object_merged+` be `+EXTERN tid { tenv venv_merged renv_merged }+`
    ..... Let `+oid+` be `+IC_0.PATH ++ [nameIR]+`
    ..... Let `+STO_3+` be `+$add_map<oid, object>(STO_2, oid, object_merged)+`
    ..... Let `+IC_1+` be `+$add_value_inst(GLOBAL, IC_0, nameIR, ! oid)+`
    ..... Result in `+IC_1+`, `+STO_2+`, and `+?()+`
   .... If ~`+$is_extern_object(object)+`
    ..... Let `+oid+` be `+IC_0.PATH ++ [nameIR]+`
    ..... Let `+STO_2+` be `+$add_map<oid, object>(STO_1, oid, object)+`
    ..... Let `+IC_1+` be `+$add_value_inst(GLOBAL, IC_0, nameIR, ! oid)+`
    ..... Result in `+IC_1+`, `+STO_1+`, and `+?()+`

  ... Else if false
   .... Let `+(cid, constructor, id*)?+` be `+$find_constructor_inst(IC_0, prefixedNameIR, argumentListIR)+`
   .... Check that `+(cid, constructor, id*)?+` matches pattern `+(_)+`
   .... Let `+?((_, constructor, and id_default*))+` be `+(cid, constructor, id*)+`?
   .... Let `+IC_inner+` be `+$enter_path(IC_0, nameIR)+`
   .... (Constructor_inst: `+cursor' IC_inner STO' |- constructor < typeArgumentListIR > ( argumentListIR # id_default* ) ==> STO_1 object+`)
   .... If `+object+` has type `+externObject+`
    ..... Let `+EXTERN tid { tenv venv renv }+` be `+object+`
    ..... Let `+IC_decl+` be `+$empty_instantiationContext+`[PATH = `+IC_0.PATH+`][GLOBAL = `+IC_0.GLOBAL+`]
    ..... Let `+objectDeclarationListIR+` be `+$flatten_objectInitializerOptIR(objectInitializerOptIR)+`
    ..... (Decls_inst: `+BLOCK IC_decl STO_1 |- objectDeclarationListIR ==> IC_decl_post STO_2 _*+`)
    ..... Let `+venv_merged+` be `+$merge_venvs(venv, IC_decl_post.BLOCK.VENV)+`
    ..... Let `+renv_merged+` be `+$merge_renv_with_extern(renv, IC_decl_post.BLOCK.RENV)+`
    ..... Let `+object_merged+` be `+EXTERN tid { tenv venv_merged renv_merged }+`
    ..... Let `+oid+` be `+IC_0.PATH ++ [nameIR]+`
    ..... Let `+STO_3+` be `+$add_map<oid, object>(STO_2, oid, object_merged)+`
    ..... Let `+IC_1+` be `+$add_value_inst(GLOBAL, IC_0, nameIR, ! oid)+`
    ..... Let `+constantDeclarationIR+` be `+CONST typeIR nameIR = ! oid ;+`
    ..... Result in `+IC_1+`, `+STO_2+`, and `+?(constantDeclarationIR)+`
   .... If ~`+$is_extern_object(object)+`
    ..... Let `+oid+` be `+IC_0.PATH ++ [nameIR]+`
    ..... Let `+STO_2+` be `+$add_map<oid, object>(STO_1, oid, object)+`
    ..... Let `+IC_1+` be `+$add_value_inst(cursor', IC_0, nameIR, ! oid)+`
    ..... Let `+constantDeclarationIR+` be `+CONST typeIR nameIR = ! oid ;+`
    ..... Result in `+IC_1+`, `+STO_1+`, and `+?(constantDeclarationIR)+`

