 .. Group packageTypeDeclarationIR: `+GLOBAL+`, `+IC_0+`, `+STO+`, and `+annotationList PACKAGE nameIR < typeParameterListIR , typeParameterListIR_inferred > ( parameterIR* ) ;+`

